        "name": "Martial Poise",
        "maxRank": 0,
        "summary": "Enter a movement command while winding up Kalista's basic attack or Pierce to lunge a short distance when she launches her attack.",
        "bodyHtml": "<span>Martial Poise</span><span>Enter a movement command while winding up Kalista's basic attack or Pierce to lunge a short distance when she launches her attack.<font size='8'><br /><br /></span><span>Lunge distance scales with boot tier</span>.<br /><br />Kalista's basic attacks have unique drawbacks. They:<span><span>Cannot be cancelled;</span><span>Miss if her target leaves vision;</span><span>Deal only <span style=\"color: #FF8C00\">90%</span> of her total attack damage.</span></span></span>",
