        "name": "Rend",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Attacks impale their targets with spears. Activate to rip the spears out, slowing and dealing escalating damage.",
        "bodyHtml": "<span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-500 italic\">Passive: </span>Kalista's spears linger in their target for 4 seconds, stacking any number of times.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-900 dark:text-white font-semibold\">Active:</span> Kalista rips the spears from nearby enemies, dealing <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(5/15/25/35/45 + (70% Attack Damage) + (65% Ability Power))</span> plus <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(7/14/21/28/35 + (20/27.5/35/42.5/50% Attack Damage) + (50% Ability Power)) physical damage</span> per spear beyond the first. <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slows</span> enemies hit by <span>(10/18/26/34/42% + (5% per 100 Ability Power))</span> for 2 seconds.<br /><br />If this Ability kills at least one target, its Cooldown is refreshed and it refunds <span>10/15/20/25/30 Mana</span>.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">This Ability deals 50% damage to epic jungle monsters.</span>",
